title portrait and square recorder, every meter lamp lit: MON (monitor on), LIM, LOW CUT and PEAK; the list's three alike
sizes 320x480 480x800 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO long
env CASSETTE_DEMO_MONITOR on
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LIM on
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LOWCUT on
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot lamp-g-all-on
expect text "MON"
expect text "LIM"
expect text "PEAK"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
